    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oburuchi bwaAhazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi yali owemiyika amakhumi kabili olwa yachaaka okhuruka, naruchila eYerusalemu emiyika ekhumi nachisasaba; ne shiyakhola akali amalayi mumoni tsiOMWAMI, shinga Daudi kuukanyene, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula yachenda munjila tsiabaruchi baIsiraeli, nakhola nende ebifwanani ebisalule khulwa emiBaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yasambilanga amalesi kelibuuliesi mwibanda liomwana waHinomu, nasamba abaanabe mumulilo, ebisinyo biabamahanga shinga olwa biali, aba OMWAMI yarusia imbeli wabaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yamalilanga emisango nasambila amalesi kelibuuliesi habundu aheechingu hosi, nokhubikulu, nomubuli musaala omutendeemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako OMWAMI Nyasayewe yamuhaana mumukhono kwomuruchi waSiria; nabo nibamuhula, nibayila abandube omukanda omukhongo mubuhambe, nibaboosia eDamasiko. Khandi yahaanwa mumukhono kwomuruchi waIsiraeli, owamuhula nobwiri obukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Peka waRemalia yeera abandu ebikhumila eshikhumi namakhumi kabili muYuda khunyanga ndala, bosi nibali abeitswoni; okhuba bali nibaleshile OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuuka babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Zikhiri, omululu weEfuraimu, yeera Maaseya omwana womuruchi, naAzirikamu omusinjilili weinzuye, naElikana owali owakhabili khumuruchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibayila abaana babwe ebikhumila ebikhumi bibili mumbambe, mbu abakhasi, nabasiani, nabakhaana, nibabayaaya ebiyaayo ebinji, nibayila ebiyaayo tsana eSamaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ebweneyo yaliyo omunabii w owa eliiralie liali Odedi; naye narula natsia okhubukaanila lihe eliali niliitsa eSamaria, nababoolela mbu Lole, okhuba OMWAMI Nyasaye wabakuuka beenywe yatiililwa Yuda oburima, niyeshichila nabahaanile mumukhono kweenywe; neenyu mubeerile mubululu obuulile kata mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano mupaaranga okhumiina abaYuda naYerusalemu bamubeele abakholi ababohe beshikhasi nabeshisaatsa; nebutswa shimuli nende ebikha bieenywe abeene imbeli w Nyasaye weenywe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mumbulile, mukalusie abahambe abo aba muhambile mubaana beenywe; okhuba oburima obululu bwOMWAMI buli khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abandi abokhubeemilisi babaEfuraimu, mbu Azaria waYohanani, Berekhia waMeshilemotsi, Yehizikia waShalumu, naAmasa waHadilai, basinjila okhufukula abo abarulile mwihe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibabasunjila mbu Shimulaleera abahambe abo hano tawe; okhuba elia mwenya okhukhola liakhaba khwifwe eshikha imbeli waNyasaye, eliakhameetwa khubionoono bieefwe nebikha bieefwe; okhuba eshikha eshia khuli ninashio neshikhongo; buliho oburima obululu khuIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abandu abo abachinga ebimanulwa nibalekha abahambe nende ebiyaayo imbeli wabakhulundu nende omukhung'aano kwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abandu aba ameera kabwe kakharalwa nibabuukha, nibabukula abahambe; ne abali eshihechenye mubo, babafwalakhwo khubiebiyaayo tsana, nibaba-fwala ebilaaro mubilenje biabwe, nibabaheelesia eshiokhulia nende amatsi, nibababakhakhwo amafura; ne bosi abali abateshele khubo babachinjila khusishili, nibabayila eYeriko, litaala tsana liemisaala chiamashindu, ewabaana babwe; mana nibakalukha eSamaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio omuruchi Ahazi yahaabila omuruchi waAshuru mbu amuhabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba abaEdomu bali nibeetsile khandi, nibahula Yuda, nibayila abahambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaFilisiti bosi bali nibeenjiile mumataala keShefela, nende eNegebu waYuda, nibabukula Betsi-shemeshi. NaAiyaloni, naGederotsi, naSoko, halala namataala kalio, naTimina namataala kalio, nende Gimizo namataala kalio; nibamenyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba OIUWAMI yali niyeesiye Yuda hasi khulwa Ahazi, omuruchi waIsiraeli; okhuba yali nakholile muYuda amakhuwa akarakhoyeele ta, niyoonoonela OMWAMI muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Tiligatsipilineseri, omuruchi waAshuru, namwitsila namunyasia, oburamutinyisia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Ahazi yabukulakhwo khubiomunzu yOMWAMI, nokhubiomunzu yomuruchi nende abakhulundu, nabimuheelesia omuruchi waAshuru; ne kata shikamukhoonya ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mundaalo tsiamatinyuke yameeta okhwonoonela OMWAMI, omuruchi Ahazi omwenoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba yabamalila emisango abanyasaye baDamasiko abamuhula; ari Shichila abanyasaye babaruchi baSiria babahabinanga bo, kho nasi ndalabamalila emisango, bambabine. Ne bamuleerela butswa obusasishi, nende Isiraeli yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Ahazi nakhung'aasia ebimanulwa bieinzu yaNyasaye, nabikhalaka ebitonye ebitonye ebimanulwa tsana bieinzu yaNyasaye, niyeekala emiliango chieinzu yOMWAMI, niyeekholela ebimalilo khubuli masanganjila muYerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi mubuli taala liosi muYuda yakholelamwo habundu aheechingu, okhusambilakhwo abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi, nasinyisia OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuukanyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amakhuwake kandi, naketsinjilatsie, okhurula khukambeli okhuula khukahelelesia, kahandiikwa mushitabu shiabaruchi baYuda naIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi nakona, nalonda khubakuukanyene, nibamuyabila mwitookho, mbu muYerusalemu; okhuba shibamwinjisia mushihembekho shiabaruchi baIsiraeli ta; naye Hezekia omwanawe naruka mushilenieshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
